        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> To verify host identity and ensure listings meet our safety and quality standards.</li>
        <li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check"></i> To send transaction alerts, flash messages, and reservation confirmation emails.</li>
